# WSO2 Integrator: BI writes this (and a fresh checkout already has it —
# it's tracked deliberately, see .gitignore), wiring an
# ai:Wso2ModelProvider this Docker deployment never configures (it uses
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY directly instead) -- if it reaches the build
# context, it crashes the container on startup
# ("ballerina.ai.wso2ProviderConfig is not configured correctly"). Must
# never ship in the image regardless of its git-tracked status.
